5. KPI Development
The following KPIs were defined and implemented:
Volume Metrics
•	Total complaints
•	Complaints by:
o	Product
o	Issue
o	State
o	Year
Performance Metrics
•	Average response time
•	Percentage of on-time responses
Customer Outcome Metrics
•	Percentage of cases:
o	Closed with explanation
o	Closed with non-monetary outcome
o	With consumer consent provided
o	Where company response indicates compliance with law
Ranking Metrics
•	Ranking of products by total complaints
•	Top 5 issues based on complaint volume using DENSE_RANK()
Distribution Metrics
•	Complaint share percentage by product using window functions:
COUNT(*) * 100.0 / SUM(COUNT(*)) OVER ()
